<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal details C/A deficit jump in 1996.</title>
<headline>Portugal details C/A deficit jump in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal had an accumulated current account deficit of 848.4 billion escudos between January and December 1996 after a deficit of 605.1 billion in the same period of 1995, the Bank of Portugal said.</p>
<p>			   Jan-Dec 96  Jan-Dec 95   Dec 96    Dec 95</p>
<p>    C/A balance	 -848.4	 -605.1	-55.5	-4.9</p>
<p>    Goods	     -1,783.1     -1,747.0     -171.6    -130.7</p>
<p>    Services	     147.1	  183.3	 16.6	13.3</p>
<p>Foreign investment</p>
<p>    in Portugal	  877.7	  160.7	 23.1     177.7</p>
<p>Portuguese investment</p>
<p>    abroad		-912.9	 -510.0	111.3	46.4</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
